#
# Requirements:
#   - git
#
# Author: James Cherti
# URL: https://github.com/jamescherti/bash-stdops
#
# Description:
# ------------
# The git-is-pushed script checks if all local commits have been pushed to that
# remote. Exits with status 1 if there are unpushed commits or if no upstream
# branch is configured.
